<name>Kissing Gate to End</name>
<desc>Go through the kissing gate and continue along the path, keeping the fence on your right. Pass through a second kissing gate and continue along the path with a fence on your left and a view of the River Glyme on your right. On reaching the stile at Waypoint 1 (from the outward leg), retrace your steps along the path you took earlier to return to the start.</desc>
